MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m01_001: You actually came? Honestly, I'd intended to head\nthere on my own.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m01_002: It's fine. I suppose we can go together to the\nAragonians' guesthouse.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m01_003: We ought to be fine so long as we merely surveil,\nthen leave! After me.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Sci_m01: <BLN>For heaven's sake.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_001: Milady, I am beginning to feel uncertain.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_002: I've held to the belief that you would see a better\nfuture only by carrying out your revenge.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_003: I thought it a way for you to be free from the\nburden of your darkness and find the light.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_004: Now, though, I can't help but question that idea.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_005: Know that my loyalty to you has not been tarnished\nin the slightest.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Buc_m01_006: Apologies... Please allow me some time to think.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Buc_m01: <BLN>My apologies.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_001: You seem to be more on edge, Miss Leda.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_002: You are aware of this as well, yes? As to what\ndarkens your mood, I won't pry.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_003: <NCA>Tell him to mind his own business.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_004: <NCB>Tell him that he's right.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_005: <ACA>So you won't admit it? In that case, as you say,\nI'll mind my own business...
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_006: <ACA>Though if you want fewer inquiries about your mood,\nyou might at least act less irritable.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_007: <ACB>Try not to show it. If you go along like this, unrest is\nsure to crop up among your allies.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Sci_m03_008: <ACB>Unfortunately, those who lead others must at times\nconceal their thoughts and feelings.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Sci_m03: <BLN>Take care.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Moo_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Moo_m01_001: Are you sure you're OK, Leda? You're not keeping\nsecrets from the rest of us or something?
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Moo_m01_002: I mean...I'm starting to worry. You seem to have a\nlot on your mind.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Moo_m01_003: I hope I'm just imagining it.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Moo_m01: <BLN>I'm worried.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_001: Somehow I was able to finish composing the song\nin time...
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_002: Had I missed the deadline, it would have been\nharmful for the reputation of Kalla's temple.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_003: It was rather a close call.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_004: I wonder if I was too focused on besting you to tap\ninto my true potential.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_005: In any case, Leilidahna, please allow me to express\nmy gratitude.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Oly_m01_006: I thought this was the end for me! Thank you for\ncoming to my rescue.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Oly_m01: <BLN>Allow me to express my gratitude.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Car_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Car_m01_001: You have made it to the main matches. One might\nsay the true battles of the Heroic Games are ahead.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Car_m01_002: The contestants are fearsome competitors...some of\nthem with faces you'll recognize.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Car_m01_003: But you must face them if you are to have your\nwish granted.
MID_LGV_1LED_c09_Car_m01_004: Make every effort, Leilidahna. To win, you must\nhone your skills and devote yourself to your studies.
MID_LGA_1LED_c09_Car_m01: <BLN>Make every effort.